baseline = "Initial git status/diff showed only runner-prepared .cgignore and spec changes; both scoped artifacts were absent. Private gate.json recorded zero builds/verifies and two repair cycles remaining; gates.jsonl was absent. No pre-change tests ran and no baseline failures are claimed: the explicit implementation-first order and hf-done-only verification override the older step asking for an unchanged-tree verify. README.md remains unchanged from its owning task throughout this task."
